## User question:
How to enable modification of VPN-Target, SoO, and Link Bandwidth extended community attributes in matched BGP routes using route-policies on a Nokia router?
---
## Proposed answer:
policy-definition modify-vpn-target-soo-bandwidth {
    if {
        match {
            extended-community {
                type vpn-target;
                operation modify;
            }
            extended-community {
                type soo;
                operation modify;
            }
            extended-community {
                type link-bandwidth;
                operation modify;
            }
        }
    } then {
        set {
            extended-community {
                type vpn-target;
                value <new_vpn_target_value>;
            }
            extended-community {
                type soo;
                value <new_soo_value>;
            }
            extended-community {
                type link-bandwidth;
                value <new_link_bandwidth_value>;
            }
        }
    }
}
router bgp <as_number> {
    policy {
        import <route_policy_name>;
    }
}
