FuncDef:
The display bgp ipv6 routing-table extcommunity command displays information about IPv6 routes with a specified extended community attribute.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'rt', 'Info': 'Displays information about IPv6 routes with the route target (RT) extended community attribute.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'soo', 'Info': 'Displays information about IPv6 routes with the source of origin (SoO) extended community attribute.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'strExtCommunity', 'Info': 'Specifies the excommunity value. IP<X.X.X.X>:NN<0-65535> or AS<0-65535>:NN<0-4294967295> or AS<65536-4294967295>:NN<0-65535> or AS<0-65535>.<0-65535>:NN<0-65535>.\nThe attribute is a BGP extended community attribute and can be expressed in any of the following formats:\n2-byte AS number:4-byte user-defined number, for example, 1:3. The AS number ranges from 0 to 65535, and the user-defined number ranges from 0 to 4294967295. The AS number and user-defined number cannot both be set to 0. Specifically, the value of the SoO attribute cannot be 0:0.IPv4-address:2-byte user-defined number, for example, 192.168.122.15:1. The IP address ranges from 0.0.0.0 to 255.255.255.255, and the user-defined number ranges from 0 to 65535.Integral 4-byte AS number:2-byte user-defined number, for example, 0:3 or 65537:3. An AS number ranges from 65536 to 4294967295. A user-defined number ranges from 0 to 65535. The AS number and user-defined number cannot be both 0s. Specifically, the value of the SoO attribute cannot be 0:0.4-byte AS number in dotted notation:2-byte user-defined number, for example, 0.0:3 or 0.1:0. A 4-byte AS number in dotted notation is in the format of x.y, where x and y are integers ranging from 1 to 65535 and from 0 to 65535, respectively. A user-defined number ranges from 0 to 65535. The AS number and user-defined number cannot be both 0s. Specifically, the value of the SoO attribute cannot be 0.0:0.'}
{'Parameters': 'match-any', 'Info': 'Displays information about IPv6 routes with any of the specified extended community attributes.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'extcommunity-filter basic-extcomm-filter-number', 'Info': 'Specifies the number of an extcommunity filter.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 1 to 199.'}
{'Parameters': 'extcommunity-filter advanced-extcomm-filter-number', 'Info': 'Specifies the number of an advanced extcommunity filter.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 200 to 399.'}
{'Parameters': 'extcommunity-filter extcomm-filter-name', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of an extcommunity filter.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 51 characters.'}
{'Parameters': 'statistics', 'Info': 'Displays statistics about IPv6 routes with the specified extended community attribute.\n-'}
