display mpls lsp asbr [ nexthop { <nexthop-addr> | <nexthop6-addr> } ] [ verbose ]
display mpls lsp protocol bgp [ nexthop { <nexthop-addr> | <nexthop6-addr> } ] [ verbose ]
display mpls lsp protocol bgp-ipv6 [ nexthop { <nexthop-addr> | <nexthop6-addr> } ] [ verbose ]
display mpls lsp protocol bgp exclude { <fec-prefix> <fec-prefix-length> | <fec6-prefix> <fec6-prefix-length> } [ lsr-role { egress | ingress | transit } ] [ verbose ]
display mpls lsp protocol bgp include { <fec-prefix> <fec-prefix-length> | <fec6-prefix> <fec6-prefix-length> } [ lsr-role { egress | ingress | transit } ] [ verbose ]
display mpls lsp protocol bgp [ nexthop { <nexthop-addr> | <nexthop6-addr> } ] lsr-role { egress | ingress | transit } [ verbose ]
display mpls lsp protocol bgp-ipv6 exclude { <fec-prefix> <fec-prefix-length> | <fec6-prefix> <fec6-prefix-length> } [ lsr-role { egress | ingress | transit } ] [ verbose ]
display mpls lsp protocol bgp-ipv6 include { <fec-prefix> <fec-prefix-length> | <fec6-prefix> <fec6-prefix-length> } [ lsr-role { egress | ingress | transit } ] [ verbose ]
display mpls lsp protocol bgp-ipv6 [ nexthop { <nexthop-addr> | <nexthop6-addr> } ] lsr-role { egress | ingress | transit } [ verbose ]
display mpls lsp asbr nexthop { <nexthop-addr> | <nexthop6-addr> } lsr-role { egress | ingress | transit } [ verbose ]
FuncDef:
The display mpls lsp asbr command displays on an ASBR information about LSPs created using BGP based on received VPNv4 or VPNv6 routes (excluding LSPs lacking forwarding tokens).
The display mpls lsp protocol bgp command displays information about LSPs created using BGP based on received IPv4 VPN routes (excluding LSPs lacking forwarding tokens).
The display mpls lsp protocol bgp-ipv6 command displays information about LSPs created using BGP based on received IPv6 VPN routes (excluding LSPs lacking forwarding tokens).
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'nexthop nexthop-addr', 'Info': 'Specifies the next hop IPv4 address.\nThis value is in dotted decimal notation. This address can be displayed using the display mpls lsp verbose command.'}
{'Parameters': 'nexthop nexthop6-addr', 'Info': 'Specifies the next hop IPv6 address.\nThe value is a 32-digit hexadecimal number, in the format of X:X:X:X:X:X:X:X.'}
{'Parameters': 'verbose', 'Info': 'Displays detailed information about LSPs.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'asbr', 'Info': 'Displays information about ASBR LSPs.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'bgp-ipv6', 'Info': 'Displays information about LSPs created using BGP based on received IPv6 VPN routes.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'exclude', 'Info': 'Displays information about LSPs that are not mapped to a specified FEC.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'fec-prefix', 'Info': 'Displays information about LSPs of a specified IPv4 address.\nThis value is in dotted decimal notation. This address can be displayed using the display mpls lsp verbose command.'}
{'Parameters': 'fec-prefix-length', 'Info': 'Specifies the mask length of the specified IPv4 address.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 0 to 32.'}
{'Parameters': 'fec6-prefix', 'Info': 'Displays information about LSPs of a specified IPv6 address.\nThe value is a 32-digit hexadecimal number, in the format of X:X:X:X:X:X:X:X.'}
{'Parameters': 'fec6-prefix-length', 'Info': 'Specifies the length of the IPv6 address prefix.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 0 to 128.'}
{'Parameters': 'lsr-role', 'Info': 'Displays information about an LSP according to the specified role of the local LSR.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'egress', 'Info': 'Displays information about LSPs with the local LSR as the egress.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'ingress', 'Info': 'Displays information about LSPs with the local LSR as the ingress.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'transit', 'Info': 'Displays information about LSPs with the local LSR as a transit node.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'include', 'Info': 'Displays information about LSPs that are mapped to a specified FEC.\n-'}
